## Brainwaves:
## Epsilon 	 .5 Hz
## Delta 	 .5 - 3 Hz
## Theta 	  3 - 8 Hz
## Alpha 	  8 - 12 Hz
## Beta 	 12 - 40 Hz
## Gamma 	 40 - 100 Hz
## Lamba	100 - 200 Hz on a .5 Hz carrier wave (epsilon) creating a "circle"

